.SS API Reference
.SS \f[CR]pkg/certificate\f[R]
.SS \f[CR]ParseFile(filename string) ([]*x509.Certificate, string, error)\f[R]
Parse a certificate file (auto\-detects PEM or DER format).
.PP
\f[B]Returns:\f[R] certificates, format (\(lqPEM\(rq or \(lqDER\(rq),
error
.SS \f[CR]ParsePEMCertificates(data []byte) ([]*x509.Certificate, error)\f[R]
Parse PEM\-encoded certificates from raw bytes.
.SS \f[CR]Display(certs []*x509.Certificate)\f[R]
Display certificates in human\-readable format to stdout.
.SS \f[CR]PrintDetails(cert *x509.Certificate)\f[R]
Print detailed certificate information to stdout.
.SS \f[CR]PrintDetailsToWriter(cert *x509.Certificate, output io.Writer)\f[R]
Print certificate details to a specific writer.
.SS \f[CR]FormatFingerprint(certRaw []byte, algorithm string) string\f[R]
Generate certificate fingerprint.
Algorithms: \(lqsha1\(rq, \(lqsha256\(rq
.SS \f[CR]Save(certs []*x509.Certificate, config SaveConfig) error\f[R]
Save certificates in specified format (pem, der, text).
.SS \f[CR]SavePEM(certs []*x509.Certificate, output io.Writer) error\f[R]
Save certificates in PEM format.
.SS \f[CR]SaveDER(certs []*x509.Certificate, output io.Writer) error\f[R]
Save certificate in DER format (leaf only).
.SS \f[CR]SaveText(certs []*x509.Certificate, output io.Writer) error\f[R]
Save certificates in human\-readable text format.
.SS \f[CR]pkg/connection\f[R]
.SS \f[CR]TestDirectTLS(config TLSConfig) ([]*x509.Certificate, tls.ConnectionState, error)\f[R]
Test a direct TLS connection (HTTPS, IMAPS, etc.).
.PP
\f[B]TLSConfig fields:\f[R] \- \f[CR]Host string\f[R] \- Target hostname
\- \f[CR]Port string\f[R] \- Target port \- \f[CR]SkipVerify bool\f[R]
\- Skip certificate verification \-
\f[CR]ConnectTimeout time.Duration\f[R] \- Connection timeout
.SS \f[CR]TestStartTLS(config StartTLSConfig) ([]*x509.Certificate, tls.ConnectionState, error)\f[R]
Test a StartTLS connection (SMTP, IMAP, POP3, etc.).
.PP
\f[B]StartTLSConfig fields:\f[R] \- \f[CR]Host string\f[R] \- Target
hostname \- \f[CR]Port string\f[R] \- Target port \-
\f[CR]SkipVerify bool\f[R] \- Skip certificate verification \-
\f[CR]ConnectTimeout time.Duration\f[R] \- Connection timeout
.SS \f[CR]PrintTLSInfo(state tls.ConnectionState)\f[R]
Print detailed TLS connection and certificate information.
.SS \f[CR]pkg/utils\f[R]
.SS \f[CR]MaskIPAddresses(text string) string\f[R]
Mask IPv4 and IPv6 addresses in text (requires
\f[CR]MAILSEND_MASK_IP\f[R] env var).
.SS \f[CR]MaskIPSlice(addresses []string) []string\f[R]
